# No Cursor git attribution

- Do **not** add `Co-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>` (or any Cursor/cursoragent trailer) to commits or PRs.
- Do **not** add `Made-with: Cursor` / "Made with Cursor" footers.
- Author and committer must be Ben Lester / `lester-01` only (`154888791+lester-01@users.noreply.github.com` or another email linked to that GitHub account).
- If a tooling layer injects those trailers, strip them before finishing the commit.
